  "label": "antisemitic_hate_target",
  "description": "The meme is designed to target Jewish people by invoking antisemitic stereotypes and metaphors rooted in the Holocaust. The phrase 'how do you like them well done please!' is a grotesque, dehumanizing trope that equates the mass murder of Jews with cooking or eating food, directly referencing historical antisemitic propaganda. The visual of Adolf Hitler, the architect of the Holocaust, is juxtaposed with this text to normalize hatred and trivialize genocide, making the intended audience those who are targeted by such hateful tropes — specifically, Jewish individuals and communities.",
